cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use klepsydra, please cite it as below.
title: "klepsydra: your Claude Code usage limit and every session, always on screen"
abstract: >-
  A thin always-on-top overlay for Windows and Linux that shows how much of the Claude Code
  usage limit has been used, fed by Claude Code's statusLine hook, and a wall of character
  cards for every Claude Code session, needs-you first.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: AJ
    family-names: Barea
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-7938-2376"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ajbarea/klepsydra"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - claude code
  - developer tooling
  - desktop overlay
